    {
      "text": "A blank Business Model Canvas template: a grid of nine labelled boxes for Key Partners, Key Activities, Value Propositions, Customer Relationships, Customer Segments, Key Resources, Channels, Cost Structure and Revenue Streams, each marked with a small icon, with blank fields at the top for designer name and date.",
